h2. Phase 1
Phase 1 focuses on adding support for a set of pre-defined custom actions that are shipped with Ambari.
* Action Definition API (readonly)
{code}
curl -u admin:admin -i http://c6401.ambari.apache.org:8080/api/v1/action_definitions

