Good catch. This is very similar to AMBARI-3721 where memory_used_percentage was being calculated as _allocated/available_ instead of _allocated/(allocated+available)_. 

This JIRA should be fixed similarly where 
{code}
seriesData = (availableData != 0) ? (allocatedData * 100) / (availableData + allocatedData) : 0;
{code}

