1.
{noformat}
+      &quot;description&quot;: &quot;Maximum value for minimum RegionServers Java heap size (Java option -Xmn)&quot;,
+      &quot;defaultValue&quot;: &quot;512&quot;,
{noformat}
We should not hardcode description, and value on ui side, it&apos;s better remove these lines, for new properties, in that case they are fetched from *-.xml files.

2.
{noformat}
+propertyUpdaters.put(&quot;hbase_regionserver_xmn_max&quot;, new MPropertyUpdater());
{noformat}
This line says we should append &apos;m&apos; to the value when deploy via blueprint, we don&apos;t want that to happen. We want &apos;512&apos;, not &apos;512m&apos;

3.
{noformat}
+            &quot;hbase_regionserver_xmn_max&quot;: &quot;512m&quot;,
{noformat}
Also in all places like this we need to use 512 not &apos;512m&apos;, that is what we need to pass to calc_xmn_from_xms function -- a raw number.

