On sles11sp1 and suse11sp1 site-packages is in /usr/lib64/python2.6 but ambari installs the agent modules in /usr/lib/python2.6. Ambari agent exports PYTHONPATH at startup but PYTHONPATH is not set by default in a normal user term session leading to the import error.
I think the simple approach is to update the instructions with an export included;
 export PYTHONPATH=/usr/lib/python2.6/site-packages;python /usr/lib/python2.6/site-packages/ambari_agent/HostCleanup.py --silent --skip=users

